{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","section":{"1":"The Book of Purification"},"section_detail":{"1":{"hadithnumber_first":1,"hadithnumber_last":324,"arabicnumber_first":1,"arabicnumber_last":324,"name_native":"Temizlik Kitabı (Taharet)"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":299,"arabicnumber":299,"text":"Yine Aişe (r.anha) rivâyet ediyor ve diyor ki: “Rasûlullah (s.a.v)’in elbisesinde meni lekesi gördüğümde. Onu, kazımak sûretiyle yok ederdim.” (İbn Mâce, Tahara:)","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":1,"hadith":300}}]}